{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "availability": "available",
      "content_state": "enhanced",
      "copy_key": "career.block.quick-decision",
      "id": "quick-decision",
      "items": [
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "如果你愿意精确测量裁切、耐心对花压平，并持续检查接缝与气泡，这个职业值得做桌面试验。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "paperhangers.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "真正难点是把基层、尺寸、材料批次、图案方向、环境条件和成品标准同时对齐。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "paperhangers.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "安全练习只审三张虚构工单的7字段：表面类型、尺寸/数量、基层状态、材料图案/批次、粘贴/对花要求、作业环境/保护、升级安排（触发+对象）。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "paperhangers.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.3",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "A：室内石膏板墙；3.2×2.6米；基层状态未知；W-24同批竖纹；直对花且接缝检查；空房并标明地面保护；“基层不明则升级项目负责人”，缺1。B：室内顶面；尺寸/数量未知；基层干燥平整；F-8同批无图案；满贴且无对花；环境/保护未知；“任一尺寸或保护不明则升级现场主管”，缺2。C：室内混凝土墙；4.0×2.8米；基层平整且已记录；V-11同批半步对花；边缘对齐并查接缝；空房且地面/邻面已保护；“批次或基层记录不一致时升级项目负责人”，缺0。结论仅作工单缺项复推，不授权现场作业。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "paperhangers.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.4",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "availability": "available",
      "content_state": "enhanced",
      "copy_key": "career.block.profile",
      "id": "profile",
      "items": [
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.definition-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "职业定义：为室内墙面或顶面铺贴装饰墙纸/织物，也可在墙面或广告牌张贴海报；可能移除旧材料或处理基层。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "paperhangers.profile.definition-block.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "onet-details"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.responsibilities-block",
          "data": {
            "entries": [
              "核对工单并测量表面、估算材料。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "paperhangers.profile.responsibilities-block.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "onet-details"
          ],
          "type": "list"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.responsibilities-block",
          "data": {
            "entries": [
              "清理、打磨、填补或封闭基层，为覆盖做准备。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "paperhangers.profile.responsibilities-block.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "onet-details"
          ],
          "type": "list"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.responsibilities-block",
          "data": {
            "entries": [
              "测量裁切材料、施胶、对齐边缘和图案。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "paperhangers.profile.responsibilities-block.3",
          "source_refs": [
            "onet-details"
          ],
          "type": "list"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.work-context-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "用刷子或滚筒压平褶皱和气泡，检查对花、接缝与整洁度。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "paperhangers.profile.work-context-block.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "onet-details"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.work-context-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "O*NET还列出设置糊台和脚手架、移除旧纸、裁边等补充任务。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "paperhangers.profile.work-context-block.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "onet-details"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.onet-structured-fields-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "输入是工单、表面、尺寸、材料与图案；输出是对齐、平整、接缝整洁的覆盖面。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "paperhangers.profile.onet-structured-fields-block.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-quick-answers-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "工作闭环可理解为：核表面→测量估料→处理基层→裁切施胶→铺贴对花→压平检查。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "paperhangers.profile.career-quick-answers-block.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-quick-answers-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "质量依据必须落到实际规格、材料说明、合同和现场验收要求。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "paperhangers.profile.career-quick-answers-block.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.definition-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "一句话：这是精确饰面安装，不是泛化的“装修全能工”。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "paperhangers.profile.definition-block.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
