          "data": {
            "entries": [
              {
                "answer": "O*NET 47-2142.00的主干是准备墙面或顶面、测量裁切墙纸/织物、施胶对花、压平接缝并检查成品，也可移除旧材料或张贴广告海报。",
                "id": "paperhangers.faq.1",
                "question_key": "career.faq.paperhangers.daily-work",
                "source_refs": [
                  "onet-details"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "47-2142.00覆盖墙面或顶面装饰材料；47-2041.00的核心对象是地面地毯、衬垫、接缝、拉伸与固定，两者按安装表面和最终交付区分。",
                "id": "paperhangers.faq.2",
                "question_key": "career.faq.paperhangers.role-comparison",
                "source_refs": [
                  "onet-carpet",
                  "onet-details"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "适配与谨慎信号是任务导向的自我观察，不是性格诊断或录用结论。",
                "id": "paperhangers.faq.3",
                "question_key": "career.faq.paperhangers.fit",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "O*NET 2025美国招聘数据只列Google Docs、Excel、Word三项软件且百分比均不可用，不能据此声称生成式AI普及率或岗位替代率。",
                "id": "paperhangers.faq.4",
                "question_key": "career.faq.paperhangers.ai-impact",
                "source_refs": [
                  "onet-tech"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "AI可帮助整理估料清单、图案编号、缺项记录和沟通草稿；人必须复核实物尺寸、基层、批次、对花、成品质量与现场安全。",
                "id": "paperhangers.faq.5",
                "question_key": "career.faq.paperhangers.human-control",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "国家统计局2025工资资料按行业和人员大类聚合，且不含个体工商户与自由职业者，不能当作裱糊工全国精确工资。",
                "id": "paperhangers.faq.6",
                "question_key": "career.faq.paperhangers.china-pay",
                "source_refs": [
                  "nbs-wages"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "O*NET展示的2025 BLS数据：美国年工资中位数52,140美元，10/25/75/90分位为36,020/44,890/60,180/69,050美元；小时中位数25.07美元。",
                "id": "paperhangers.faq.7",
                "question_key": "career.faq.paperhangers.us-pay",
                "source_refs": [
                  "onet-wages"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "O*NET将该职业列为Job Zone 1-2，通常高中或GED、数天至一年在职训练，并列有Paperhanger注册学徒职业名称示例。",
                "id": "paperhangers.faq.8",
                "question_key": "career.faq.paperhangers.education-path",
                "source_refs": [
                  "onet-summary"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "发现表面、材料、图案、环境或权限条件不明时，编辑建议仅记录复核对象、责任人、复核时间和升级触发/对象；实际停复工按现场现行程序。",
                "id": "paperhangers.faq.9",
                "question_key": "career.faq.paperhangers.risk-boundary",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "O*NET/BLS列出2024年就业2,300，2024—2034增长5%—6%，期间预计空缺200；空缺包含增长与替代。",
                "id": "paperhangers.faq.10",
                "question_key": "career.faq.paperhangers.outlook-transition",
                "source_refs": [
                  "onet-summary"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "职业判断还要核对地区、雇佣/承包形态、项目来源、表面材料和现场要求；总体预测不等于个人录用概率。",
                "id": "paperhangers.faq.11",
                "question_key": "career.faq.paperhangers.career-worth",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "id": "paperhangers.sources.faq.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial",
            "nbs-wages",
            "onet-carpet",
            "onet-details",
            "onet-summary",
            "onet-tech",
            "onet-wages"
          ],
          "type": "faq"
        },
        {
